N:closing the book before the ink was dry, or something like that -
N:several pages, including this one, show signs of other notes at 45
N:degrees to the  music written on the page. * - this note has no stem.
N:the crochet C in the second bar of the A music is shown as a note-head
N:with no tail.  Bar lines are as shown in the manuscript. Cherri.G.
N:Ed..I've put two bar lines in, as it makes no difference to the tune.
